@startuml task_delivery_snapshot_event
!pragma layout smetana
title 标式化投影任务: delivery_snapshot_event
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

database "开始状态 exact resource scope" as SOURCE
database "没有变化 outbox" as OUTBOX
participant "任务投影器" as PROJECTOR
database "类型任务" as TASKS
participant "工人机" as WORKER
database "卫生公共投影" as PROJECTION
database "公众活动存储器" as EVENTS
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as DISPATCHER
actor "客户端" as Client

SOURCE -> OUTBOX : 已固定域名事件
OUTBOX -> PROJECTOR : 没有变化的事件
PROJECTOR -> TASKS : immutable delivery_snapshot_event\n(outbox_event_uuid, exact scope)\nunique derivation; 没有 coalescing
TASKS -> WORKER : exact scope lease + fencing
WORKER -> SOURCE : 阅读最后一个 exact-scope 情况
group 一个 DB transaction
  WORKER -> PROJECTION : 具有潜力的卫生照
  WORKER -> EVENTS : durable ready event, 如果宣布 contract kind
end
EVENTS -> DISPATCHER : 稳定的记录
DISPATCHER -> Client : 发送 / 重复 / 播放

note over SOURCE,PROJECTION
  Provider JSON 只有 provider/delivery.
  为了 draft/push 没有 public event task 记录 effect guard
  没有 event row.
  协议原始元数据和帐户数据保持隐藏.
  Lifecycle: lease expiry, retry/backoff, DLQ/reaper;
  idempotent effect guard 根据 outbox_event_uuid.
end note

@enduml
